## Continuous Improvement

### Regular Reviews
1. **Weekly SonarQube reports** - review and address new issues
2. **Code review guidelines** - include SonarQube compliance in reviews
3. **Team training** - educate team on common issues and solutions
4. **Quality gate enforcement** - prevent merging code with SonarQube violations

### Automation
1. **Pre-commit hooks** - run static analysis before commits
2. **CI/CD integration** - include SonarQube analysis in build pipeline
3. **Quality gates** - enforce quality standards automatically
4. **Notification systems** - alert team of quality issues

This guide should be referenced during code reviews and before committing changes to ensure high code quality and SonarQube compliance.